{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hannah VCR is a narrative puzzle game where you manipulate a VHS tape to change Hannah's destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each colored square on the tape represents a part of the scene. You decide the order, and Hannah moves forward alone, facing a world broken by memories, abandonment... and the search for a lost doll.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available in two versions: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR: Control the tape with your own hands in an immersive environment that simulates a forgotten room.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional: Use your controller on console or PC to solve each level from a classic and challenging perspective.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a retro aesthetic, immersive music, and an emotionally charged design, Hannah VCR is a thrilling experience filled with mystery and the things that never fully heal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewind. Change the order. Maybe this time, you'll manage to save her.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The collection begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2695600/b1603320cafc98da282483b82cf4ac6ac002796d.jpg"},{"name":"Half way there","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2695600/eb406ef764ef008dce0d128971821b0a8bb5257c.jpg"},{"name":"Switch up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2695600/10410ff38ff06f60a3fea9416f3a13f615013924.jpg"},{"name":"Paint it RGB","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2695600/45bf9834f49e49096f75b825b1ebaadfde2dc64b.jpg"},{"name":"Cut through","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2695600/95805cbe38b8252ab1eded9ba62e